@startuml UcAccountNotifications
title Use case diagram 1 of 3: account and notifications
left to right direction
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "IUB Community\nMember" as Member
actor "IUB Records" as Records <<system>>
actor "Message Delivery\nService" as Messenger <<system>>

rectangle "Campus Complaint & Maintenance System" {
  usecase "UC-01 Register Account" as UC01
  usecase "UC-02 Log In" as UC02
  usecase "UC-03 Log Out" as UC03
  usecase "UC-04 Reset Password" as UC04
  usecase "UC-05 View Notifications" as UC05
}

Member --> UC01
Member --> UC02
Member --> UC03
Member --> UC04
Member --> UC05
UC01 -- Records
UC02 -- Records
UC04 -- Records
UC01 -- Messenger
UC04 -- Messenger

note bottom of Member
  Every user is an IUB Community Member:
  Student, Faculty Member, University
  Administration, Maintenance Staff and
  Maintenance Supervisor.
end note
@enduml